th=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f0b00df9e9f03ad345d20f67cb070574.webm?t=1741783783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f0b00df9e9f03ad345d20f67cb070574.mp4?t=1741783783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is <strong>2035</strong>. A powerful energy corporation, O.R.E., has built a private military to defend its <strong>monopoly on Red Orpiment, a rare mineral set to power the world</strong>, while local governments and resistance fighters battle to reclaim control. You are the tip of the spear in the war to control it\u2014<strong>which side will you take?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong> Playtests begin this summer!</strong><br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Wishlist now to be the first to fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Join our community:</strong> </p>",
